#: ../../quickstart.rst:2
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "快速上手"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:4
msgid "Five minutes from launch to a figure."
msgstr "五分钟，从打开到出图。"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:7
msgid "1. Open a locus"
msgstr "1. 打开一个位点"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:9
msgid ""
"Type a locus into the search box at the top and press :kbd:`Enter`. All of "
"these work:"
msgstr "在顶部搜索框输入位点，按 :kbd:`Enter`。下面这些写法都支持："

#: ../../quickstart.rst:19
msgid ""
"A gene symbol jumps to its full extent; coordinates are 1-based and "
"inclusive, matching the IGV convention."
msgstr "基因名会跳到它的完整范围；坐标是 1-based 闭区间，与 IGV 约定一致。"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:23
msgid "2. Choose an assembly"
msgstr "2. 选择装配"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:25
msgid ""
"The assembly selector sits next to the search box. Orbit ships with 18 "
"assemblies — see :doc:`assemblies`. Changing the assembly keeps the locus "
"text if the chromosome name also exists in the new genome."
msgstr ""
"装配选择器在搜索框旁边。Orbit 内置 18 个装配，见 "
":doc:`assemblies`。切换装配时，如果新基因组里也有同名染色体，位点文本会保留。"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:30
msgid "3. Look at the tracks"
msgstr "3. 看轨道"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:32
msgid ""
"The left column lists tracks. Click a name to open its settings, or use the "
"checkbox to hide it. From top to bottom you normally see:"
msgstr "左栏列出所有轨道。点名称打开设置，用复选框隐藏。从上到下通常是："

#: ../../quickstart.rst:35
msgid "**Ideogram** — cytobands with the current view marked"
msgstr "**染色体示意图** —— 细胞遗传带，标出当前视野"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:36
msgid "**Ruler** — genomic coordinates and scale"
msgstr "**标尺** —— 基因组坐标与比例"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:37
msgid "**RefSeq genes** — gene models, expandable to transcripts"
msgstr "**RefSeq 基因** —— 基因模型，可展开到转录本"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:38
msgid "**Signal tracks** — any bigWig you have loaded"
msgstr "**信号轨道** —— 你载入的任意 bigWig"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:39
msgid "**GC content** — computed from the sequence on demand"
msgstr "**GC 含量** —— 按需从序列计算"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:40
msgid "**Sequence** — bases, once you are zoomed in far enough"
msgstr "**序列** —— 放大到足够近时显示碱基"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:43
msgid "4. Load your own data"
msgstr "4. 载入自己的数据"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:45
msgid ""
"Drag a file onto the window, or press **Import** in the toolbar. bigWig, "
"bedGraph, BAM, GTF/GFF and FASTA are recognised by extension. Details in "
":doc:`data-import`."
msgstr ""
"把文件拖进窗口，或点工具栏的 **导入**。bigWig、bedGraph、BAM、GTF/GFF 和 FASTA 按扩展名识别。详见 "
":doc:`data-import`。"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:50
msgid "5. Export the view"
msgstr "5. 导出视图"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:52
msgid ""
"Press the export button in the toolbar and choose PNG, SVG or PDF. Vector "
"formats stay editable in Illustrator and Inkscape. Details in :doc:`data-"
"export`."
msgstr ""
"点工具栏的导出按钮，选 PNG、SVG 或 PDF。矢量格式在 Illustrator 和 Inkscape 里仍可编辑。详见 :doc:`data-"
"export`。"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:57
msgid "Keyboard essentials"
msgstr "常用快捷键"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:63
msgid "Key"
msgstr "按键"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:64
msgid "Action"
msgstr "动作"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:65
msgid ":kbd:`←` / :kbd:`→`"
msgstr ":kbd:`←` / :kbd:`→`"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:66
msgid "Pan by half a screen"
msgstr "平移半屏"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:67
msgid ":kbd:`Shift` + :kbd:`←` / :kbd:`→`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Shift` + :kbd:`←` / :kbd:`→`"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:68
msgid "Pan by a tenth of a screen"
msgstr "平移十分之一屏"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:69
msgid ":kbd:`+` / :kbd:`-`"
msgstr ":kbd:`+` / :kbd:`-`"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:70
msgid "Zoom in / out"
msgstr "放大 / 缩小"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:71
msgid ":kbd:`Ctrl` + :kbd:`F`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Ctrl` + :kbd:`F`"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:72
msgid "Focus the search box"
msgstr "定位到搜索框"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:73
msgid ":kbd:`Ctrl` + :kbd:`S`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Ctrl` + :kbd:`S`"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:74
msgid "Export the current view"
msgstr "导出当前视图"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:75
msgid ":kbd:`Esc`"
msgstr ":kbd:`Esc`"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:76
msgid "Close the current dialog or clear the selection"
msgstr "关闭当前对话框或清除选区"

#: ../../quickstart.rst:80
msgid ""
"Dragging horizontally on the ruler pans the view; dragging on a gene track "
"selects a region and shows its size."
msgstr "在标尺上横向拖动可平移视图；在基因轨道上拖动会选中一个区域并显示其长度。"

